## Tested in the packaging environment

- Python syntax compilation
- CLI help/import
- 26 automated tests
- deep-model forward passes on CPU
- model checksum validation
- deliberate-corruption rollback test
- audit-chain tamper detection
- API health and validation tests
- response-policy and upload-security tests

Full NF-UQ-NIDS-v2 training, Windows Npcap capture, CUDA training, Docker Desktop, and Windows Firewall changes were not executed in the packaging environment. See `TEST_REPORT.md`.
